<title>USA: IMM currency futures end mixed, trade quiet late.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures end mixed, trade quiet late.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 16 - IMM currency futures ended mixed after quiet trade late. Traders note seller of 700 Sept Canada late, possibly a spread with Aussie dollar. A NY bank said to have bought 1,000 Sept yen on close. Sept peso more than recovers Tuesday's huge losses. Sept peso volume estimated at 11,000.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
